mapping "X2894.1" source="X2894" target="269705003" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source X2894 SNOMED CT 269705003 is a Swedish national extension of WHO base Contact with other
        specified venomous plants (ICD-10 id 45756387); the Swedish suffix subdivides the base by a
        place/activity external-cause axis with no distinct standard SNOMED CT clinical analogue. Base
        event Athena-crosswalks to SNOMED CT 4155221 (concept_code 269705003) via ICD10 relationship
        45756387 -> 4155221. The Swedish place/activity qualifier is external-cause metadata; the injury
        event is unchanged. Target subsumes the event -> broader. Confidence : verified Athena crosswalk
        on the WHO base, one-level broader (qualifier dropped).
        """
}
